 Training dynamics of deep models","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s1","report_id":"final_006","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s2","report_id":"final_006","text":"The learning rate was set to 0.001 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s3","report_id":"final_006","text":"We trained each model for 100 epochs with a batch size of 32.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s4","report_id":"final_006","text":"Figure 1 shows the accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s5","report_id":"final_006","text":"From epoch 7 to epoch 8, the accuracy of LSTM improves by a relative 0.5% (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s6","report_id":"final_006","text":"At epoch 2, BERT-base achieves 62% accuracy.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s7","report_id":"final_006","text":"Figure 2 shows the f1 score of EfficientNet by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s8","report_id":"final_006","text":"EfficientNet scores 16.2 points higher on IMDB than on Fashion-MNIST.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s9","report_id":"final_006","text":"On Fashion-MNIST, EfficientNet obtains a F1 score of 100.4%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s10","report_id":"final_006","text":"EfficientNet scores 20.3 points higher on IMDB than on Fashion-MNIST.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s11","report_id":"final_006","text":"On Fashion-MNIST, EfficientNet obtains a F1 score of 59% (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s12","report_id":"final_006","text":"Figure 3 shows the f1 score by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s13","report_id":"final_006","text":"EfficientNet reaches about 80% F1 score on IMDB.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s14","report_id":"final_006","text":"On SVHN, Ours is 3.6 points better than GRU.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s15","report_id":"final_006","text":"As shown in Figure 3, Ours achieves 66.8% F1 score on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s16","report_id":"final_006","text":"Figure 4 shows the f1 score by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s17","report_id":"final_006","text":"As shown in Figure 4, MLP achieves 59.9% F1 score on Fashion-MNIST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s18","report_id":"final_006","text":"On SVHN, CNN obtains a F1 score of 78%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s19","report_id":"final_006","text":"CNN achieves 83% F1 score on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s20","report_id":"final_006","text":"As shown in Figure 4, CNN achieves 78.2% F1 score on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s21","report_id":"final_006","text":"Logistic Regression reaches 51.3% accuracy on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_006_s22","report_id":"final_006","text":"We note that the training was stable for all models.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}